# The action verbs over first-login-walk-jump: log in as the recording's character, then turn,
# jump and rotate the camera by their retail action names. Each `dump events` shows the route the
# action took through the frame's handlers.
login first-login-walk-jump +Aldis
hold MovementTurnLeft 0.3
dump events
press MovementJump
dump events
hold CameraRotateLeft 0.2
dump events
quit
